  "seoTitle": "Accessibility | Advice4you",
  "description": "How we make the Advice4you website accessible, and photo credits.",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#04070f\",\"text\":\"#e8ecf2\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#04070f;color:#e8ecf2;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Accessibility</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f6f3ec\",\"text\":\"#0e1424\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f6f3ec;color:#0e1424;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last updated: 2026-10-11</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our aim</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We want everyone to be able to use this website. We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What you can do on this website</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read every page in six languages, including Sorani Kurdish written right to left.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use the whole site with a keyboard or a screen reader.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make the text larger with your browser settings without losing content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Turn off animation with the reduced motion setting on your device.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Translations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>English is the original language of this website. If any part of a translation is unclear, please tell us and we will explain it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tell us about a problem</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If something on this website is hard to use, please contact us by WhatsApp, phone or email. We will do our best to fix it and to give you the information another way.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Photo credits</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Photos from Unsplash, by:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/FehG1VqkvUY\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Pull’s Ferry, the old flint water gate on the River Wensum in Norwich</a>, <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@arpitamukh1\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Arpita Ghosh</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/a96YinP0asI\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">The Norwich skyline with the cathedral spire and the castle</a>, <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@danielsturleyphotography\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Daniel Sturley</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/yVbZ9DZ9_68\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Elm Hill, a historic cobbled street in Norwich, at night</a>, <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@cspalton\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Chris Spalton</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/qLSBFHg5pls\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">A windmill by the water on the Norfolk Broads in early autumn</a>, <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@hulberto\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Will Hulbert</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/NggSDMYm5K8\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">A handwritten letter on a wooden table</a>, <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@simonbhray\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Simon Ray</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/tA1N5B8O-nI\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hands writing a note at a table</a>, <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@kellysikkema\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Kelly Sikkema</a></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
